Subject: [PATCH -next] pinctrl: ti-iodelay: Fix platform_no_drv_owner.cocci warnings
Message-Id: <1548207411-15190-1-git-send-email-yuehaibing@huawei.com>
List-Id: <kernel-janitors.vger.kernel.org>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"
